@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

card "C1 check\n(valid sample < 20%\n=> safe intent OFF)" as C1
card "Safe OFF\n(logic result)" as SO
card "OFF request\ntransmitted" as TX
card "ACK /\nregister readback" as ACK
card "Load feedback\n(contact, motion, flow)" as LF

C1 --> SO
SO --> TX
TX --> ACK
ACK --> LF
note bottom of ACK
  Claim only up to the last stage
  with evidence, e.g. "OFF request ACK
  received; actual stop unconfirmed".
end note
@enduml
